@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FCFCFA
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #334155
  LifeLineBorderColor #64748B
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF1F8
  ParticipantBorderColor #334155
}
title UML Sequence — Evidence-Producing Testbed Deployment

actor "Engineer" as Eng
participant "MTP-to-Run\nAssistant" as AI
participant "Human Gates" as Gate
participant "CI/CD" as CI
participant "Testbed" as TB
participant "OTEL / Evidence" as EV
participant "Test Authority" as TA

Eng -> AI: Select approved inputs and use case
AI -> AI: Classify statements and create manifest
AI -> Eng: Propose BOM alternatives, assumptions and tests
Eng -> Gate: Request G1/G2 review
Gate --> Eng: Approved candidate and conditions
Eng -> AI: Request IaC and test drafts
AI --> Eng: Pull request with provenance
Eng -> CI: Submit reviewed candidate
CI -> CI: Schema, lint, policy, SBOM and plan checks
CI -> Gate: Request G3/G4 authorization
Gate --> CI: Permit isolated execution
CI -> TB: Apply candidate configuration
TB -> EV: Runtime traces, logs, metrics and events
CI -> TB: Execute health, performance and resilience tests
CI -> EV: Results, commit, pipeline and environment metadata
CI -> TB: Exercise rollback
TB -> EV: Rollback observation
EV -> EV: Validate evidence-envelope completeness
EV --> TA: Evidence package and unresolved gaps
TA -> TA: Assess residual risk and uncertainty
TA --> Eng: Draft GO / CONDITIONAL GO / NO-GO dossier

note over Gate,TA
Material decisions remain human and attributable.
The pilot does not authorize autonomous production apply.
end note
@enduml
